   "source": [
    "# Cora and CiteSeer benchmarks\n",
    "### CSCE 566 · Problem 4\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook compares [DeepWalk](https://arxiv.org/abs/1403.6652) and a two-layer [Graph Convolutional Network](https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.02907) for paper topic classification. Run it beside `benchmark.py` and the `dataset/` folder. The Python environment needs NumPy, pandas, SciPy, NetworkX, PyTorch, scikit-learn, threadpoolctl, and Matplotlib.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Evaluation protocol\n",
    "\n",
    
